MOUNT [device letter]
  A device (or a device's folder) given a drive letter - UniDOS. The slot
  stays on its own drive: CV changes that. MOUNT alone: the drives with
  paths and the devices.
  MOUNT SD E   MOUNT SD: E:      drive E is SD:
  MOUNT SD:GAMES F               drive F is SD:'s folder GAMES
  MOUNT - E                      drive E's path dropped
  C-P only (A and B are UniDOS's own, Z CyborgOS's, not the boot drive).
  Then COPY C:NAME.EXT E: copies between them.
